---
title: The Aetheric Field
tags:
  - axiom
date: 2024-08-20T00:00:00-04:00
---

The Aetheric field is a non-uniform distribution of energy spread across the entire [[Geography/index|Astra]]. It's the sole source of arcane energy across the Astra (although most tap into the field through a [[Phenomena/Weave|Weave]] as an intermediary). While the Aether cannot be physically touched, it can be indirectly manipulated -- as specified in the [[Phenomena/Aetheric Laws|Aetheric Laws]].
